---
import Card from "./Card.astro";

// The About page: your name and role, the write-up on the left and the
// headshot on the right. The paragraphs are filler until the real write-up
// is ready: replace them below. Styles are in game.css under "About page".
---

<Card id="about" title="About Me" class="about-card">
  <div class="about-text">
    <p class="about-name">Nam Bui</p>
    <p class="about-role">Software Engineer</p>

    <p class="card-lead">
      Hi! I'm a recent Computer Science graduate from the University of Michigan
      with an interest in building interactive, user-focused software.
    </p>

    <p>
      My experience spans full-stack web development, working with
      technologies like React, JavaScript, TypeScript, Node.js, and
      databases. I'm always looking for opportunities to learn,
      experiment with new technologies, and become a better engineer.
    </p>

    <p>
      When I'm not coding, I'm probably dancing. I've done 
      hip-hop for 4 years, choreographing pieces and performing in teams.
      Teaching my own choreography taught me that if people can't follow it, 
      it's not their fault, it's the piece. I think about code the same way.
    </p>

    <p>
      Thanks for visiting my website! I'm excited to keep building, keep learning, and see where the
      next level takes me.
    </p>
  </div>

  <figure class="about-photo">
    <img src="/headshot.webp" width="640" height="800" alt="Nam Bui" />
  </figure>
</Card>